WEBVTT

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:09.290
I'd heard there were a number 
of disappearances in town lately...

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:11.280
I take it that's your doing.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.810
I've only been using crooks 
and slaves as feed for them, haven't I?

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.370
Well, mostly.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:20.450
Y-you're going too far...

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.020
Sir Fumba!

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:26.200
A-And this place is supposed to be a secret,

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.480
yet you bring these whores 
here to... fraternize?

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:31.440
What were you thinking?!

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.170
Oh...

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.280
I get my work done, don't I?

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:40.110
Emperor Domitianus won't mind if I—

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.100
S-such impudence!

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.390
Do not speak His Imperial Highness's name!

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.530
Oh, sorry about that.

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:49.470
Still, you lot are the ones 
who wanted my help, right?

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:54.440
And what of this plan to fell the nation?

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.830
Walk this way.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.120
They're looking a bit hungry, I'd say.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:15.380
No!

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:17.870
No—

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:27.560
Don't eat so fast.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.520
You'll get bones stuck 
in your throats, you hear?

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:19.380
Then this is the border town of Kaysehk?

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:23.840
I suppose this means we've 
entered the Holy Revlon Empire.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.470
<i>Hi there. It's me, Arc.</i>

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:32.130
<i>We'd heard that kidnapped elves 
had been brought to this town,</i>

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:35.100
<i>and managed to make our way here, but...</i>

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.520
You can tell this town is 
on the empire's border.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:43.570
They've got everything buttoned up tight.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:48.620
The kind of place where conspicuous 
moves will likely draw trouble...

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:54.170
which makes searching 
for the elves even more difficult.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.830
We'll have to take the slow 
and steady approach.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:01.540
Let's split up and then rendezvous 
here before the sun sets.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:03.880
Understood.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.500
How's that?

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.220
Those are walnuts with honey.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.060
Taste good?

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:32.410
Okay, so if I review what 
I've managed to learn...

00:04:32.890 --> 00:04:36.880
Strange cries have been heard 
from a fortress in the east, late at night.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:40.980
Monsters have been appearing 
on the edges of the empire's territory.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:45.760
And people have been going 
missing in town lately...

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:49.720
This place is apparently 
a lot less secure than it looks.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:53.450
And no word on what we're 
actually looking for:

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.400
kidnapped elves.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:58.630
This might be harder than I thought, Ponta.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:03.030
It's nearly time.

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:06.070
Let's go and meet up with Lady Ariane.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:17.100
Damn it, I can't believe this 
whore has given us the run-around.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.720
We've got quotas to meet, all right?

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.800
D-Don't...

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:24.130
Stop making this harder than it needs to be!

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:27.960
We're just gonna take you 
to where all your friends are.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.700
That was you lot, then?!

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.520
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:38.940
Now hold on a moment. 
Can't you see the girl's terrified?

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:41.400
Piss off, you bastard! Let go of me!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.320
Bastard!

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.360
Mind your own business!

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.150
Armored Head Flick!

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.160
Justice is served.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:00.960
Whoa there!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.290
What's the matter? Were you injured?

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:08.460
Thank you so much for saving me.

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:13.180
I'm sure it was a dreadful experience. 
You needn't worry—

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:13.180
Oh, there you are!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:16.630
Get this, Arc! I've got a lead that should—

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.720
Oh, Lady Ariane!

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:25.440
And who might this be?

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.590
It seems these rogues were attacking her.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:33.050
Arc, do you always stick your nose 
into every bit of trouble you find?

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.410
If it's within my reach, yes.

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:42.880
Well, she doesn't seem to be hurt much.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.000
You should hurry on home.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.280
But... I should at least thank him...

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:51.820
You should go home. Okay?

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:53.680
R-Right!

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:59.520
She certainly seemed afraid.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:03.980
I must admit,

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:08.950
I'm ashamed you had to trouble 
yourself by finding me, Lady Ariane.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.820
It's fine.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:16.280
I must ask, what has you feeling so prickly?

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:17.920
I'm not!

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:21.910
She is, isn't she?

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:31.880
Can you boys seriously not 
even scrounge up a bit of food?

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.020
Or is it something else? 
You think I'm having a laugh, here?

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.770
I-It's not like that!

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.750
It's all his fault!

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:42.070
You're the one who let the woman get away!

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:48.020
God, I don't care. 
You get to be dinner, instead.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:48.750
If you hadn't—

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:52.950
And with that being the case... Bye-bye.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.080
You can't...!

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:55.080
Mr. Fumba!

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:05.510
Scary...

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:07.370
Just sit tight, okay?

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:11.210
I'll round up something tasty for you.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:25.610
Four months ago, 
elves were brought to this fortress.

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:29.350
But four months...

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:35.240
It's likely they're gone already. 
Or possibly even worse.

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:39.120
You're right. But still...

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:44.490
I'm willing to gamble on them being alive.

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:48.120
It was a boorish point to make. Forgive me.

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:58.530
I'm impressed you were able to 
find such precise intel.

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:01.760
Well, I had some help with that.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.930
While a certain someone was helping himself
to some woman on the street...

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:09.630
I see! Well, that is wonderful.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:17.160
So, who was this informant?

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:21.420
Lady Ariane?

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:22.950
What?

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.990
Are you still feeling prickly?

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:26.340
I am not!

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.930
But she is, isn't she?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.680
There appears to be no one around.

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:47.140
It's too quiet.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.560
If the intel was right, this is the spot.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:53.980
Here?

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.200
A hidden door!

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:06.680
This smell...

00:10:06.680 --> 00:10:09.600
Right. It smells of beasts.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:20.040
I'll take the one on the left.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.720
The right it is, then.

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:29.270
Hey, isn't that a cottontail fox?

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.120
Who goes there?!

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:45.310
No good. It won't budge.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:46.250
Let's see...

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.440
Oh, it slides open!

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.840
What kind of door does that?!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.330
The stench is intense...

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.220
Yes.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.300
It appears to be some 
kind of underground prison.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.530
But...

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:09.000
Animal fur?

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.620
Hopefully a normal animal...

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:31.680
What is this?

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:35.680
You don't usually see such 
massive underground spaces.

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:38.740
Is that... blood that I smell?

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:40.520
Damn it...

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:46.920
My pets were making a fuss, 
so I came to check it out.

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.680
Who the hell are you two?

00:11:49.240 --> 00:11:50.520
Lady Ariane...

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:54.290
I've gotta feed the big one soon.

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:56.000
So I don't need—

00:11:57.520 --> 00:12:00.910
Well, you're a luscious one, 
aren't you, girlie?

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.280
H-Huh?!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:06.540
Okay, you're mine from now on!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:09.030
Now, kill off the rust bucket for me.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:11.240
What is with this ruffian?

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:13.330
Let's teach him a lesson, 
and find out what he knows!

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:21.720
L-Lady Ariane! 
You're attacking the wrong foe!

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:28.020
No mistake here, rust bucket.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:31.630
Now pipe down and die.

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:33.480
What have you done?!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:37.510
Come on, man, no one ever teach you 
to pay attention in a fight?

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.560
The lady you're with...

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:41.200
She's pretty fierce, ain't she?

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:51.320
Oh, is this for real?! She's a dark elf?!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.240
I've hit the bloody jackpot!

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:57.010
Hey, girlie! Hurry up and kill him!

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:02.280
<i>Something is clearly wrong. 
Has she been bewitched?</i>

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:04.510
In that case...

00:13:05.510 --> 00:13:07.720
<b>U
n
c
u
r
s
e</b>

00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:06.720
Uncurse!

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:10.060
Good!

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.180
What?!

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.440
The spell's unbroken?!

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.370
Lady Ariane!

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:25.950
Episode 11

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:25.950
The Monster-Taming Barbarian Laughs in the Darkness

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:33.080
Wake up, Arin.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:37.640
Sister Eevin...?

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.420
Come, now. It's time to train.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:44.650
Train...?

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.480
Right.

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:50.840
You're weak, so you need to train more.

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:54.310
I'm... weak?

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.610
You are.

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:58.770
And as you are now, 
you won't be able to save anyone.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:06.080
Weakness is evil. 
The weak exist only to be taken from.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:08.690
So you need to become strong!

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:14.230
That way you can protect everyone 
from the humans, who subjugate elves.

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:17.340
Now, draw your sword...

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:21.260
Prove to me how strong you are.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.240
Uncurse!

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:28.720
Uncurse!

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.180
Uncurse!

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:35.560
Why?! Why is the spell unbroken?!

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.240
Lady Ariane!

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:44.770
<i>I can feel that the dispelling is effective.</i>

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.920
<i>It's not as if my magic 
isn't doing anything...</i>

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:51.830
<i>And he doesn't appear 
to be casting a spell himself.</i>

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.630
<i>I saw that!</i>

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:07.410
<i>Then that's the game!</i>

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:08.320
Ponta!

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:16.670
Fire!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.180
<b>F
i
r
e</b>

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.360
Lady Ariane!

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:29.590
Oh, man, that was just brutal.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:34.160
He was my cute little pet, mate.

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:36.880
An imp...

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:41.170
it was casting an illusion while hiding 
in a blind spot this entire time.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.360
You've got sharp senses 
for a walking scrap pile.

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:48.390
Here's a little prize 
for your sharp observations:

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:51.550
I'm a Rozombanya Monster Sorcerer...

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:55.110
Fumba Soodu Rozombanya.

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:57.110
Monster Sorcery?

00:15:57.110 --> 00:16:00.850
I can make monsters do whatever I want.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:04.310
Not many of my ilk 
out in the world, y'know?

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:07.890
And especially not as good at it as me!

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:10.850
I can control any damn 
monster you can think of...

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:13.120
and as many as I need!

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:17.460
<i>He controls monsters... 
A monster tamer, then!</i>

00:16:20.050 --> 00:16:21.040
<i>Is that...?</i>

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:29.490
<i>Could he have been the one...?</i>

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:32.640
You don't have to believe me, though.

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:34.210
Either way...

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:38.700
you're gonna be dinner.

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.100
A question.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:50.160
Four months ago, a group 
of elves were brought here.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.520
Where are they?

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:54.440
Elves?

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:58.240
We get all types around here...

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:01.130
Oh, I know who you mean!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:04.590
If you remember, that simplifies things.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:05.960
Tell me what you know.

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:08.190
They're long gone!

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:09.200
What?

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:14.670
Most of them got used up 
in the empire's magic experiments.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:18.130
Now those are some truly nasty bastards!

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:24.100
And I took real good care of the ones 
that were left behind...

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:31.020
The last one was screaming 
their head off about killing me,

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:35.820
but after I fed their limbs 
to my precious here, they sure quieted down!

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.090
It was a right laugh!

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:52.920
I've seen my fair share of villainy 
since coming here...

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:56.370
And in spite of it all I was able to stay calm...

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.600
But you?

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:01.800
You're stoking the flames of my rage!

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:05.270
I don't really give a rat's ass!

00:18:05.270 --> 00:18:09.240
And you're gonna need to kill a lot more 
than one before you start acting cocky!

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:12.400
I've got a whole menagerie 
left to throw at you!

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:23.960
Ogres, giant basilisks, 
and monsters I've never seen before...

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:27.050
But their numbers won't suffice.

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:29.300
Keep talking!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:32.320
We'll see how you feel 
once they've shit you out!

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.460
Go!

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.230
There's more where that came from!

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:54.260
Combat skill 
of the base-tier class, Soldier:

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.280
<b>S
h
i
e
