d

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.280
<b>S
h
i
e
l
d

00:18:54.980 --> 00:18:57.280
<b>S
h
i
e
l
d

00:18:55.240 --> 00:18:57.280
Shield Bash!

00:19:09.490 --> 00:19:14.340
Bloody hell, man, is there 
a minotaur inside of all that armor?

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:19.260
Your partner's in a spot of trouble, though.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:24.920
Lady Ariane!

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:35.200
Body to water: Liquid Prison!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:35.190
<b>Body
to
water
Liquid
Prison</b>

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:41.620
It seems I made it in time, Sir Arc.

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:42.880
Lady Chiyome!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:47.030
Great, more of them.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:50.790
I've got plenty more pieces to play, though!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:51.910
No, you don't.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:56.510
The monsters in this area 
have already been dealt with.

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:58.040
What?!

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:17.560
And without your monster 
pawns, you are powerless.

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:19.850
Damn it!

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:24.080
You have any idea how much 
effort I put into those beasts?!

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:26.280
Lady Chiyome, you've saved the day!

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:29.680
But what are you doing here?

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:32.390
Huh? Did she not tell you?

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:34.880
I was going to join with you two later.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:39.650
Then you were the one 
who provided her with the intel!

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:43.760
I never heard all the details, actually.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.270
Lady Ariane was feeling quite prickly 
at the time, you see.

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:47.850
Prickly?

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:53.920
Wh-What is this shaking?

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:59.400
Oh, he's awake now...

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.930
Well, I guess dinner is late.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:06.450
Good timing, though.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.650
Let's pick this up outside!

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:11.780
I'll let you go up against my masterpiece!

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:14.760
If you can make it out alive, anyway!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.760
Wait!

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:18.600
Sir Arc!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:21.590
Lady Ariane needs to be escorted to safety!

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:52.510
Is... that...

00:21:52.930 --> 00:21:55.230
With extreme regeneration,

00:21:55.230 --> 00:21:57.720
